msgid ""
"As shown above, the PLUMED actions can be inputted explicitly in the Python "
"script for the ASE input:"
msgstr "上に示すように、PLUMED の Actions は、ASE 入力用の Python スクリプトに直接記述できる。"

#: INPUTS.md:114
msgid ""
"To set up a metadynamics simulation with multiple walkers, you need to "
"specify the number of walkers by WALKERS_N, the walker index by WALKERS_ID "
"(which starts from 0), the directory which stores the bias potentials by "
"WALKERS_DIR, and the frequency of the walkers reading the bias potential "
"files by WALKERS_RSTRIDE."
msgstr ""
"Multiple Walkers Metadynamics を設定するには、Walkers の数を WALKERS_N、0から始まる Walker "
"の番号を WALKERS_ID、BiasPotentials を保存するディレクトリを WALKERS_DIR、各 Walker が "
"BiasPotential ファイルを読み込む頻度を WALKERS_RSTRIDE で指定する。"
